	"data": "The Spectrum Room — A Room 2.0 Narrative\n\nWhat it feels like to stand inside the electromagnetic landscape.\n\nThe Walk-In\n\nYou come downstairs in the morning. Coffee in hand. The Quest 3 is already on — you've been wearing it since you left the bedroom, the house gently annotated with its usual layer of context. The thermostat by the stairs shows 68°F. Star's chassis by the desk pulses a soft blue ring — idle, healthy, all systems nominal. The Pi on the shelf has a small floating tag:…",
